#: data/io.github.taskmanager.TaskManager.metainfo.xml.in:6
msgid "Task Manager Developers"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.taskmanager.TaskManager.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Task Manager shows the processes, performance, details and services of your "
"system in a familiar tabbed interface: per-process CPU, memory, disk and "
"network usage with heat colouring, live graphs for CPU, memory, disks, "
"network, GPU, fans and batteries, a flat process list with owners and "
"states, and systemd services you can start, stop and restart."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.taskmanager.TaskManager.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid ""
"Task Manager is based on Mission Center: it uses the Mission Center "
"statistics backend (magpie) and code from the Mission Center project by the "
"Mission Center Developers (GPL-3.0-or-later). Its interface is written from "
"scratch with egui."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.taskmanager.TaskManager.metainfo.xml.in:39
msgid ""
"New interface in the style of a classic desktop task manager; per-process "
"network usage without extra permissions; interface state kept across "
"restarts."
msgstr ""
